<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Parkour Auto Longjump</Major>
    <Description>Hello! I made this script to make it easier to do a full longjump!

How to use: Just run over to an edge of a building (not totally at the edge but a bit forward) and just simple toggle it!

Needed resolution (optional): 1920x1080</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 274 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 49 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 75 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 424 ms
MiddleDown 1
KeyDown 44 1
MiddleUp 1
Delay 95 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 165 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 189 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 49 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 64 ms
KeyDown 29 1
MiddleDown 1
KeyDown 44 1
MiddleUp 1
Delay 64
Delay 69 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 150 ms
KeyUp 44 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>